# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:3
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_27c44724:

    # "Stepping closer towards the water bank, I glanced down at my reflection flickering in the water for a moment."
    "水辺に近づきながら、水面に揺れる自分の姿を一瞬見下ろした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:4
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_6c633067:

    # "I noticed {i}something red and glimmering{/i} approaching almost hypnotically slow."
    "{i}赤く輝く何か{/i}が催眠術にかかったようにゆっくりと近づいてくることに気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:5
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_0b4100ee:

    # "I felt every hair stand on my neck as I felt the sudden urge to leap back."
    "突然、飛び退きたくなる衝動に駆られ、首の毛が一本ずつ逆立つのを感じた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:6
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_8258d701:

    # "As I did so, the thing emerged violently from the water, it's single red eye glaring towards me."
    "そうするうちに、それは勢いよく水面から飛び出し、赤い単眼が私を睨みつけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:11
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_6ce7cf8c:

    # "Bound inside its horrifying seal, the Guardians were half dissolved, most already dead, lifelessly floating in the acidic mass."
    "不気味な封印の中に囚われ、守護者たちは半ば溶解し、大半は既に死んで、無機質に酸性の塊の中を漂っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:13
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_b34c3a87:

    # "One though, a girl, all bones with her eyes peeled back as she cried did her best to stretch out a dissolved hand to me."
    "ただ一つ、骨だけの少女が、剥き出しの目で泣きながら、私に向かって溶けた手を必死に伸ばしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:14
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_2beac591:

    # "Screaming inside her silent prison, the slime forced its way down her throat and she trembled as her eyes rolled white."
    "無音の檻の中で叫びながら、スライムは彼女の喉へと押し込まれ、白目を剥いて震えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:15
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_a94588ca:

    # "Then, she was as lifeless as all the others."
    "そうして、彼女も他の者たちのように命のないものとなった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:17
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_37f5d75c:

    # "With little time to waste, I tore away at my flesh and stared down the horrific monstrosity before me."
    "無駄にする暇などない、私は肉を引き裂き、眼前の恐怖の怪物を睨みつけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:31
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_3a2cf159:

    # "Dissolving into the ground and sizziling, the growling monstrosity's cries began to die down into a distorted murmur till it lay silent."
    "地面に溶け込み、じゅうじゅうと音を立てながら、唸る怪物の叫び声は次第に歪なささやきへと変わり、やがて静寂に包まれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:39
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_04ed3727:

    # MC @ talk "{i}*Huff... Huff*{/i}"
    MC @ talk "{i}はぁ… はぁ…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:41
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_e0522a7a:

    # MC "(That was too close.)"
    MC "(危ないところだった。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:42
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_6e156aba:

    # "From behind, I could hear the sounds of painful grunts and scuffling."
    "後ろから、苦しそうなうめき声と、ごそごそと動く音が聞こえてきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:43
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_1a0739a8:

    # "I turned quickly expecting some other horror from the lake ready to strike."
    "素早く振り返った。湖からまた別の恐怖が襲いかかろうとしていると予期しながら。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:44
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_a1ea6482:

    # "Instead, I saw a young knight clad in armour dragging his way across the grass away from me."
    "その代わり、私が見たのは、鎧を纏った若い騎士が、草むらを私から遠ざかるように引きずるように進んでいく姿だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:45
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_362573b6:

    # "His left leg missing as he dragged a trail of blood behind him, I approached him cautiously, reaching out towards him with my hand outstretched."
    "彼の左足は失われ、血の跡を引きずりながら、私は慎重に近づいていった。手を伸ばし、彼に向けて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:46
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_9b24d71e:

    # "The man turned weakly to swing his sword at me, but I managed to pull back in time and dodge it."
    "男は弱々しく振り向いて私に剣を振るうが、私はかろうじて間一髪で身を引いてそれをかわした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:52
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_bad462e1:

    # "His face was ghosty white, his eyes wide in fear as he cried at me between his heavy, desperate breaths."
    "彼の顔は青ざめ、恐怖で見開かれた瞳が、必死な息遣いの合間に、私に向かって泣き叫んでいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:54
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_c147c09c:

    # UNKNOWN "Back! BACK!"
    UNKNOWN "下がれ!　下がれ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:55
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_811721cd:

    # MC "Hold! I am not here to hurt you!"
    MC "待て! 私はあなたを傷つけるために来たのではありません!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:56
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_1d8f5d96:

    # UNKNOWN "You... You speak, {i}beast?{/i}"
    UNKNOWN "おまえ… 喋るのか、{i}けものが{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:57
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_507e8001:

    # MC "I'm here for the guardians."
    MC "守護者たちを迎えに来た。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:58
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_b72ffe15:

    # "The man began to laugh, and then cry as tears streamed down his eyes."
    "男は笑いだしたが、やがて泣きだし、目から涙が溢れた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:59
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_538d0203:

    # UNKNOWN "Hahahaha!"
    UNKNOWN "はははは!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:60
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_c4d9c865:

    # UNKNOWN "You've found them!"
    UNKNOWN "見つけた!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:61
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_68d2559e:

    # UNKNOWN "At least {i}*cough*{/i} the bits and pieces left of us."
    UNKNOWN "少なくとも{i}*咳*{/i}私たちの断片だけは。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:62
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_a54a637c:

    # MC "You're bleeding out, if we don't get the wound treated and sealed soon you'll die."
    MC "出血がひどい、すぐに傷の手当てと止血をしないと、君は死ぬ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:63
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_3e8bf0ee:

    # UNKNOWN "{i}*Cough!*{/i} It's hopeless... I'm finished."
    UNKNOWN "{i}*ゴホン!*{/i} もうだめだ…終わりだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:64
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_86322c55:

    # MC "Who are you?"
    MC "あなたは誰ですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:65
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_0f09202a:

    # UNKNOWN "Dravenham... At your service... What's left of it."
    UNKNOWN "ドレイヴァンハム…ご用命を…かつての面影もない者ですが。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:67
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_7f2bdaab:

    # DRAVENHAM "They sent {i}you{/i} to rescue us?"
    DRAVENHAM "私たちを救うのに{i}あなた{/i}を？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:68
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_bacefd2e:

    # DRAVENHAM "I've never seen a beast like you before."
    DRAVENHAM "君のような化け物は見たことがない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:69
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_291e3248:

    # MC "I'm afraid there's no rescue party."
    MC "残念ですが、救助隊はいません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:70
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_7c3c7716:

    # MC "I came looking for information on a missing person."
    MC "行方不明者の情報を尋ねて来ました。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:71
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_073fa195:

    # DRAVENHAM "What?! Are you fucki- *cough*"
    DRAVENHAM "なに?! くそっ――*咳*"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:72
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_e8e7195c:

    # MC "No one knows how dire your adventure ended up."
    MC "誰も知らない、君の冒険がどれほど悲惨な結末を迎えたかを。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:73
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_8595b89d:

    # "The man began to sob once again, barely managing to hold himself together."
    "その男はまたしても、かろうじて自分を保つ程度に嗚咽を漏らし始めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:74
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_15ba15f6:

    # DRAVENHAM "Elsa... Roca... Twhain... I failed them..."
    DRAVENHAM "エルザ…ロカ…トウェイン…私は彼らを見捨ててしまった…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:75
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_a8eea1de:

    # MC "Dravenham, I know you are in pain but I fear our time together is short, I can hear your heartbeat slow down."
    MC "ドレヴェンハム、君の苦しみは分かっている…でも、僕たちに残された時間は少ない。君の心臓の鼓動がゆっくりと弱くなっていく音が聞こえる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:76
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_c448d59c:

    # DRAVENHAM "Then ask, {i}beast{/i}... Ask whatever it is you have to."
    DRAVENHAM "ならば問うがいい、{i}野獣{/i}よ… 聞きたいことを聞くがいい"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:81
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_5305a2f1:

    # DRAVENHAM "None... The thing only kept me alive to let its young feed on me."
    DRAVENHAM "(空行)
そいつが俺を生かし続けてやがったのは、ただ自分の子供に俺を喰らわせるためだった。
None...
The thing only kept me alive to let its young feed on me."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:82
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_a48cb7f1:

    # DRAVENHAM "{i}*Huff*{/i} It wouldn't let me leave... It wouldn't let me fucking leave!"
    DRAVENHAM "{i}はあ{/i}…出してくれなかった…ちっとも出してくれなかったんだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:83
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_6fb79e61:

    # MC "Stay with me Dravenham."
    MC "私と一緒にいて、ドレイヴンハム。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:84
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_9b9da1a5:

    # DRAVENHAM "Please... Everything is so numb now."
    DRAVENHAM "お願い…  
全てがもう感覚を失っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:88
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_1c097716:

    # DRAVENHAM "We weren't just here for the quest..."
    DRAVENHAM "俺たちが来たのは単にクエストのためじゃない…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:89
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_1c698585:

    # DRAVENHAM "A servant of some minor nobles offered to pay us triple if we could capture a baby slimelark and bring it back."
    DRAVENHAM "とある下級貴族の使用人が、幼体のスライムラークを捕まえて持ち帰ってくれれば、報酬を3倍で頼むと言ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:90
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_d69f71d0:

    # MC "But why?"
    MC "だけど、なぜ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:91
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_ee00bc87:

    # DRAVENHAM "The young... Slimelarks can take many forms, including beautiful women, if trained."
    DRAVENHAM "若き…スライムラークは、訓練次第で美少女を含む様々な姿を取ることができる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:92
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_17540028:

    # DRAVENHAM "The fucking perverts wanted to keep a few as their own private slaves."
    DRAVENHAM "忌々しい変態どもは、何人かを個人用奴隷として飼いたがっていたんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:93
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_b6fbbabd:

    # MC "Who?"
    MC "誰？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:94
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_cb60938e:

    # DRAVENHAM "Don't know... The servant only told us he was acting as a intermediary."
    DRAVENHAM "分からない…使用人はただ、彼が仲介役を務めていると言っただけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:95
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_28c2a94f:

    # DRAVENHAM "None of them care about us, we're all just expendable to them."
    DRAVENHAM "奴らは誰一人として我々を気にかけていない、我々は皆、奴らにとっては使い捨ての駒なのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:96
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_272db056:

    # DRAVENHAM "Urghh... I feel so dizzy..."
    DRAVENHAM "うっ…めまいがする…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:97
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_e9b9815c:

    # MC "Focus! Just a little more!"
    MC "集中!あと少し!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:103
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_dbbff41e:

    # DRAVENHAM "Azul? Yes... I know of him."
    DRAVENHAM "アズール？ああ…知ってるよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:104
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_def48cf3:

    # DRAVENHAM "He would offer us advice on our quests..."
    DRAVENHAM "彼は私たちの冒険中にアドバイスをくれるんだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:105
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_046e0255:

    # DRAVENHAM "For coin."
    DRAVENHAM "金貨のために。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:106
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_eb43210d:

    # DRAVENHAM "Something hap-*cough* happened?"
    DRAVENHAM "何か起き…*ゴホン*…ました？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:107
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_90a466a3:

    # MC "He's gone missing."
    MC "彼は行方不明です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:108
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_c1daa0a7:

    # MC "What did he talk to you about the last time you saw him?"
    MC "最後に会った時、彼は何について話していましたか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:109
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_f051d7a2:

    # DRAVENHAM "Missing? Crap..."
    DRAVENHAM "いないの？　くそ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:110
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_c0de04b1:

    # DRAVENHAM "He was afraid of something."
    DRAVENHAM "彼は何かを恐れていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:111
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_652cae32:

    # DRAVENHAM "He said he had information that could end up in..."
    DRAVENHAM "奴が言うには、とんでもない事態に行き着く可能性がある情報を持ってるそうだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:112
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_85baa545:

    # "Dravenham mustered himself, grasping for life slipping away."
    "ドレイブンハムは力を振り絞って、過ぎ去ろうとする命を必死に掴もうとした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:113
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_0d88fc3a:

    # DRAVENHAM "...In the wrong hands."
    DRAVENHAM "間違った者に渡れば。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:114
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_91226212:

    # DRAVENHAM "\"Send the whole guild into chaos\" he said..."
    DRAVENHAM "「ギルド全体を混乱に陥れる」と彼は言った…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:115
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_10740462:

    # DRAVENHAM "He then asked if he could hire us for protection, but by then, we'd already taken on... this."
    DRAVENHAM "彼はそれから護衛として雇えないかと尋ねたが、その時には我々はすでに……これを引き受けてしまっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:116
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_0e6917de:

    # DRAVENHAM "We were going to help him afterwards..."
    DRAVENHAM "手伝うつもりだったのに…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:117
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_89117cef:

    # DRAVENHAM "Ha... I guess as you can see, that didn't work out."
    DRAVENHAM "はあ…見ての通り、うまくいかなかったな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:118
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_eb69671d:

    # MC "Where is he now?"
    MC "彼は今どこにいるの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_2.5.rpy:119
translate ja qst_bloodhound_2_lake_postbattle_dravenham_1d788dbb:

    # DRAVENHAM "He gave... {i}Urghh...{/i} an address to a safehouse of his."
